, brings the ore home, forges it into weapons and armor and wears whatever is best.\n\nFEATURES\n- Trains in the best free train area your rebirth unlocks - the gamepass areas are filtered out\n- Farms stage 27, the deepest one. That is the whole game: stage 5 ore forged a Train 500 weapon, stage 27 ore forged Train 150,000,000 - one forge, 300,000 times stronger\n- Returns after every run, because ore only reaches your inventory once you go back\n- Forges weapons AND armor and equips the best, valued exactly the way the game itself computes gear\n- Sells the weaker gear for coins and buys the Ore Bag, Train and Luck upgrades\n- Claims every Index entry and every index rank reward\n- Runs the Frozen Tower - all 30 rounds on one ticket - for enchant stones, claims the daily ticket and enchants your worn gear\n- Rolls races only while you have free rolls, never buys one, and wears the best race\n- Auto rebirth and anti-AFK\n\nMOBILE\nWorks on PC and mobile - the panel asks once and scales itself, and it speaks German, English and Russian. Every setting survives a rejoin.\n\nHOW TO RUN\n1. Open [Races]+1 Loot To Forge\n2. Paste the loader into your executor\n3. Execute - the panel opens by itself\n4. Press RightShift to show or hide it\n\nNo key, no ads, and it never spends Robux - paid train areas, rebirth skips, race rolls and ticket packs all stay shut.\n\nOpen source, read it before you run it:\nhttps://github.com/seltonmt012/sel01-rbx/blob/main/games/loottoforge.lua","tags":["auto farm","auto forge","auto train","auto rebirth","no key"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/ARdpzFuKMm","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6a83833ecf50fbf20351384b","username":"Seltonmt","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0ded360520c1951d28fd502cf078aeca6b05bb87c667cba5445a03bd584b31ec.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6a83833ecf50fbf20351384b-1787205594420.png"},"lvl":7,"status":"offline","id":"6a83833ecf50fbf20351384b","topMilestone":{"key":"crea